# Proxy the resources index and short links to the comment-to-DM worker.
#
# These are rewrites (status 200), not redirects, so the browser stays on
# donalleniii.me. Both paths are new: nothing on this site answers /links or
# /go/ today, so no existing page changes behaviour.
#
# Remove these three lines to undo. The worker keeps serving the same content
# on its own URL either way, so links already sent never break.

/links      https://comment-to-dm.donallenthethird.workers.dev/links      200
/links/*    https://comment-to-dm.donallenthethird.workers.dev/links/:splat  200
/go/*       https://comment-to-dm.donallenthethird.workers.dev/go/:splat   200
